          "instructions": "Professional, concise, and paced for an introductory business audience.",
          "text": "The order becomes useful only when its data is trustworthy. Required fields are validated, identifiers connect related records, and business rules prevent impossible states. The same reliable record can support inventory, billing, customer service, and fulfillment without each team inventing a different version of what happened."
